{"version":1,"content":"<p>【注意 ⚠️】Synology 官方晚上緊急發布公告，證實目前有 NAS 用家遭加密資料並勒索贖金。</p><p>官方目前認為攻擊者是利用 2024 年 12 月已修補的安全性弱點，鎖定當前仍執行過時 DSM 版本的裝置；</p><p>但有受災戶在 Reddit 留言，表示自己已經更新至 7.2.1 69057 Update 9 (2026-01-29)，但依然中了 .L0ck3D 勒索攻擊。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:23:02.645760+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T15:15:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T18:38:48.798760+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T15:18:20.383564+00:00","content_hash":"5965ae2bc89bfa1d1781fc4f200540a74dd287a27f9be6171274bf6b0b8b0697","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}